{
  "job_B3.3.12_20251003_114654": {
    "chunk_text": "Ac hie w\u00e6ron gemyndige ealra Godes beboda, & on \u00e6lce wisan hie w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan \u00e6 swi\u00fee & nu seo heora iugo\u00fe & seo midfyrhtnes butan \u00e6ghwylcum leahtre gestanden, hwylc talge we \u00feonne Seo Elizabe\u00fe \u00feonne w\u00e6s unw\u00e6stmf\u00e6st \u00feara godcundra m\u00e6gena, & \u00feeah \u00fee heo \u00fe\u00e6s bearnes lata w\u00e6re; For\u00feon \u00fee mycelre tide \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re halignesse hus gecl\u00e6nsod beon sceolde, & seo gastli\u00fenes \u00fe\u00e6s Cristes & seo heall \u00fe\u00e6s Halgan Gastes swylc templ eallinga Gode weor\u00fee funden w\u00e6s Haliges Gastes snytro & \u00fea \u00fee \u00e6ghwylc mennisc leahter on \u00fe\u00e6m eadigan Sancte Iohanne cennendum gestilled w\u00e6s, & hie on \u00dea w\u00e6s acynned se mon Sancte Iohannes, se w\u00e6s mara & selra eallum o\u00ferum mannum. He w\u00e6s gelic Godes englum, & he w\u00e6s beme, Cristes fricca on \u00feysne middangeard, & w\u00e6s Godes & ic secge \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere w\u00e6s f\u00e6stnung \u00e6g\u00feer ge \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6, ge \u00fe\u00e6re niwan ge \u00feonne, for\u00feon For\u00feon hie \u00fe\u00e6re an his gebyrde oforstag ealle \u00e6 \u00feisse menniscan gecynde. Ond nu seo Cristes gebyrd \u00e6t his \u00e6riste, se niwa eorendel Sanctus Iohannes; & nu nu se leoma \u00fe\u00e6re Sylle se friccea his stefne. & for\u00feon \u00fee nu \u00fe\u00e6t is se dema Drihten Crist, seo beme Sanctus Iohannes,",
